       "Blend Model (base)                                  2941.20            855.60   \n",
       "Blend Model + Correcao Estrutural                   3852.90           -415.10   \n",
       "SARIMAX (media x dias uteis) (base)                 3616.20            692.40   \n",
       "SARIMAX (media x dias uteis) + Correcao Estrutural  4275.40            100.70   \n",
       "Ridge (base)                                        4262.00            355.70   \n",
       "Ridge + Correcao Estrutural                         4712.40            120.70   \n",
       "\n",
       "                                                       N  \n",
